  </td></tr></table>
  <p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#333333;">We typically help firms save <strong>5-10 hours per week</strong> by automating these workflows with AI — not a chatbot, but actual process automation that runs in the background.</p>
  <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#333333;">I'd like to offer a <strong>free 30-minute video call</strong> where I show you 2-3 real examples relevant to ${s.industryLabel}. No pitch, no commitment — just practical examples you can evaluate.</p>
